  "id": "USN-8418-1",
  "summary": "libcrypt-saltedhash-perl vulnerability",
  "details": "It was discovered that Crypt-SaltedHash incorrectly generated salts using a\ncryptographically weak pseudo-random number generator. An attacker could\npossibly use this issue to predict generated salts, leading to a weakening\nof cryptographic protections.",
